# Line endings, pinned so every clone agrees (same policy as methodica-math-ratio-01/05).
# Every text blob in the index is already LF (`git ls-files --eol`), so this
# renormalises nothing; it also pins the working tree to LF on Windows, so
# packages copied from any machine are byte-identical.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mp3   binary

*.svg   text eol=lf

# Production delivery bundles (git archive / export) leave out development-only assets.
# The files stay in the repository; only the exported bundle omits them.
methodica-ar-math-ratio-03-*/tests/ export-ignore
methodica-ar-math-ratio-03-*/docs/ export-ignore
